Offline password deny-list snapshot
Source: https://github.com/danielmiessler/SecLists/blob/master/Passwords/Common-Credentials/10k-most-common.txt
Retrieved: 2026-11-11
SHA-256: 68782d6a4a19a4768d5f15dd66bd534e7a33055cc755411e33f16d18c50fdcce
License: MIT; see SecLists-LICENSE.txt in this directory.

This is a public list of common weak values, not stored user credentials.
It is checked locally when choosing a new password; no password is sent to a third party.
The snapshot is finite and is not a complete or continuously updated breach database.
